ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AOr98eI5zBkQ7kNvwHpipFw&_nc_oc=AdoyTMBjmvHvcMWFGa09XrRJ1wNDChG-_m_PM7WfUo0ZXqzuVzjrxZYeaGCyrRvwrkk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Sm5SHWygbv1GOYmyZgCelDu2Cux3ScDsVMUbJTC9GgQ&oe=6A13177C"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZWGlHaKNmRgQ7kNvwHAh4A_&_nc_oc=Adrr6Dj4x58Rp9xXyKYhOr2pWKRnRSstNp3EfckNKnRk5wwKXcYr2NwV3CTjTOkBvEI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Q-jJY-ZWuSiEDCaLl0UpJPgQXehrHQp8Wz2p0iLVnhw&oe=6A12FB96"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N5H9Gq0CIA4Q7kNvwHVCLeC&_nc_oc=AdoXGcp6BYwenqSeaqjuAIVVzCwqr1F-8kBQE48zX-zW7McBCWWDVNTfYhEUL_xxPME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af43DYobZ8L_XN8_6Dz7y9C6Ut3wzzkExOXvh0iBbXvDKw&oe=6A130964"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_